/**
 * \mainpage xtsci-optimize
 *
 * Rust rewrite of HaoZeke/xtsci-optimize. Solvers live in Rust over
 * eindir `DifferentiableObjective`s. This HTML is the C / C++ hourglass.
 *
 * - \c xts_minimize is the only entry. Tensors are dlpk
 *   `DLManagedTensorVersioned`.
 * - \c include/xts/optimize.hpp wraps that entry for C++.
 * - \c include/xts/xtensor.hpp adapts `xt::xarray`.
 *
 * Production unconstrained method: L-BFGS (Nocedal-Wright 7.4) with
 * the strong Wolfe conditions (algorithms 3.5 and 3.6).
 *
 * Narrative docs live in `docs/orgmode/`. Rust rustdoc is `cargo doc`.
 */
